  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rural Investment &amp; Services Project (APL #1)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is the first phase of a two-phase APL.  The program objective is to provide long-term support to accelerate agricultural recovery and growth so that Moldova&apos;s agricultural sector can play its full role in providing the underpinnings for future income growth and poverty reduction.  Within this broader objective, the project objective is to foster post-privatization growth in the agricultural sector by improving the access of new private farmers and rural businesses to what they need to succeed - legal ownership status, knowledge, know-how, and finance. The first phase will initiate priority interventions in policy, legal and regulatory reforms, institutional capacity building technical assistance, and investment support.</narrative>
  </description>
